n\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"main\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wrapper\">\n<!-- response -->\n<p><p><strong>Name:</strong><br /><span>Catherine Maldonado</span></p><p><strong>Email:</strong><br /><span>catherinesmaldonado@gmail.com</span></p><p><strong>Message:</strong><br /><span>Hey there,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI hope you are doing well.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI was checking your website and saw you have a good design and it looks great, but it\'s not AI optimized like chatgpt,‎Google Gemini &amp; perplexity other major AI.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease let me tell you some of the techniques that I can use below to help you get a better result on  major AI:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. AI keyword clustering<br />\r\n2. Semantic SEO with natural language optimization<br />\r\n3. Entity SEO (for E-E-A-T and AI search ranking)<br />\r\n4. AI image compression &amp; enhancement<br />\r\n5. Alt tag generation via vision AI<br />\r\n6. AI chatbot for 24/7 consultation booking, common FAQs, service guides<br />\r\n7. Lead qualification + calendar integration<br />\r\n8. Dynamic homepage &amp; blog content generation<br />\r\n9. Auto-update blogs<br />\r\n10.AI-based user behavior analysis<br />\r\n11.Scroll maps &amp; click tracking to find weak spots<br />\r\n12.Funnel optimization suggestions<br />\r\n13.Core Web Vitals optimization via AI suggestions<br />\r\n14.Lazy loading images, script deferrals using AI-based audits<br />\r\n15.AI-based CDN selection &amp; optimization<br />\r\n16.Optimize for Google Lens and Siri/Alexa-based search<br />\r\n17.Structured data markup with AI tools<br />\r\n18.Image naming, alt text, schema via AI<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe\'ve got lots to do together to make you stand out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease give us the chance to work with you. You can see our rates on our website.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLooking forward to working with you.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nKindest regards,<br />\r\nCatherine Maldonado</span></p></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table class=\"button_block\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\n				<tr>\n					<td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\">\n						<a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-admin#/responses?status=inbox&#038;r=1879\" data-tracks-link-desc=\"\">\n							<!--[if mso]>\n							<i style=\"mso-text-raise: 30pt;\">&nbsp;</i>\n							<![endif]-->\n							<span>View in dashboard</span>\n							<!--[if mso]>\n							<i>&nbsp;</i>\n							<![endif]-->\n						</a>\n					</td>\n				</tr>\n			</table>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- START FOOTER -->\n<div class=\"footer\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"content-block wrapper\">\n<!-- footer -->\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px\">Time: September 2, 2025 at 8:51 am<br />IP Address: 202.78.236.237<br /><br />Source URL: https://seoservicessk.com/<br /><br /><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-admin#/responses?status=inbox&#038;r=1879&#038;mark_as_spam\">Mark as spam</a><br /><br />Sent by an unverified visitor to your site.<br /></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"content-block powered-by\">\nPowered by <a href=\"https://jetpack.com/forms/?utm_source=jetpack-forms&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=form-submissions\">Jetpack Forms</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"collapse\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<img src=\"https://pixel.wp.com/t.gif?_en=jetpack_forms_email_open&_ui=e68c6b50c9df1454375d0a4484c49d0c&_ut=anon&browser_type=php-agent&_aua=tracks-client-v0.3&_ts=1756803071532\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" />\n</body>\n</html>\n\";}'),
