\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"main\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wrapper\">\n<!-- response -->\n<p><p><strong>Name:</strong><br /><span>Jorge Lanzas</span></p><p><strong>Email:</strong><br /><span>partnerships@submtrsender.com</span></p><p><strong>Message:</strong><br /><span>Subject: Exploring Potential Partnership Opportunity<br />\r\nFor: Owner or General Manager<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood Afternoon,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI’m Jorge, founder of Submtr. I’m reaching out because we partner with B2B lead generation agencies to help them generate six-figure B2B partnership conversations for their end clients.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe would like to see how we can work together.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis system targets key decision-makers in any industry. It has generated multiple six-figure sales conversations and is being used by several US-based B2B brands as a white-labeled outbound channel.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow this partnership benefits your company:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n• Generate six-figure pipeline conversations without email, domains, warmup time, or inbox risk<br />\r\n• Your Team keeps full ownership of client relationships, pricing, and margins. We handle all backend execution<br />\r\n• Improve retention with a channel competitors are not using.<br />\r\n• Add an outbound channel you can resell under your own brand with Zero internal build and simultaneously create a new recurring revenue stream<br />\r\n• Launch campaigns the same day. Scale across 5, 10, or 20+ client accounts with predictable execution and outcomes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe system has already generated over $1M in closed sales, with a current $750K deal in the pipeline sourced through it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat time works best for you on Thursday for a video call to discuss potential synergies?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAttentively,<br />\r\nJorge Lanzas<br />\r\nOwner<br />\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/jorgelanzas/</span></p></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table class=\"button_