\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"main\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wrapper\">\n<!-- response -->\n<p><p><strong>Name:</strong><br /><span>Rahul Bagdi</span></p><p><strong>Email:</strong><br /><span>rahul.bagdiseoservice@gmail.com</span></p><p><strong>Message:</strong><br /><span>Hi,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHope you are doing well.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI am reaching out to introduce our Blogger Outreach and Guest Posting services. We have been working in this industry since 2012, helping businesses, agencies, and SEO professionals strengthen their online presence through high-quality, niche-relevant publications.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOver the years, we have built strong relationships with hundreds of real, authoritative blogs across multiple categories such as Business, Tech, Lifestyle, Health, Finance, Education, Travel, and more. All sites offer:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n•	High Domain Authority &amp; organic traffic<br />\r\n•	Real, updated content (no PBNs)<br />\r\n•	Do follow links as required<br />\r\n•	Permanent posts with fast turnaround time<br />\r\n•	Competitive pricing for bulk orders<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you need backlinks, brand exposure, or long-term SEO growth, we can provide tailored placements based on your niche and budget.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you are interested, please reply to this email. I would be happy to share our latest site list, pricing details, and available placement options.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRegards!<br />\r\nRahul</span></p></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table class=\"button_block\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\n					<tr>\n						<td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\">\n							<a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-admin#/responses?status=inbox&#038;r=2662\" data-tracks-link-desc=\"\">\n								<!--[if mso]>\n								<i style=\"mso-text-raise: 30pt;\">&nb