\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"main\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wrapper\">\n<!-- response -->\n<p><p><strong>Name:</strong><br /><span>Sarah Anderson</span></p><p><strong>Email:</strong><br /><span>sarahand@remotetact.com</span></p><p><strong>Message:</strong><br /><span>Hi there,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMy earlier email bounced, so I wanted to follow up here.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe keep hearing the same thing from digital marketers: you work hard to spark conversations in the DMs. Interest builds. Replies come in. Then volume increases. High-intent leads get buried under noise. Follow-ups slip and momentum dies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is not a lead problem; it is a system problem.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is why we built FlowChat. It is one central pipeline to track every direct message across every platform, so no opportunity gets lost and no conversation goes cold.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI know it is a long shot, but if you want to see how FlowChat protects your conversion rate as volume grows, just reply \"yes.\"<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest, <br />\r\nSarah</span></p></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table class=\"button_block\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\n					<tr>\n						<td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\">\n							<a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-admin#/responses?status=inbox&#038;r=2743\" data-tracks-link-desc=\"\">\n								<!--[if mso]>\n								<i style=\"mso-text-raise: 30pt;\">&nbsp;</i>\n								<![endif]-->\n								<span>View in dashboard</span>\n								<!--[if mso]>\n								<i>&nbsp;</i>\n								<![endif]-->\n							</a>\n						</td>\n					</tr>\n				</table>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- START FOOTER -->\n<div class=\"footer\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"content-block wrapper\">\n<!-- footer -->\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px\">Time: F