\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"main\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wrapper\">\n<!-- response -->\n<p><p><strong>Name:</strong><br /><span>Ian Mokua</span></p><p><strong>Email:</strong><br /><span>ian@smartblasts.co</span></p><p><strong>Message:</strong><br /><span>Hey there,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI’m Ian, and I wanted to share a simple way your agency could get more calls and bring in more clients.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis approach works because every message is sent from the business’s own domain email. So if you reach out to 10,000 businesses, your message is delivered from 10,000 different real email addresses. That’s why messages go straight to inboxes, not spam, and why open rates stay high.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere’s how it works. You choose your target niche and message, and your outreach is sent through contact forms. You then focus on replying, booking calls, and managing conversations from your inbox.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurious if this would be useful for your agency or your clients running B2B campaigns?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nP.S. This message is a live example of Smartblasts in action. It shows how your message reaches inboxes and gets attention.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest<br />\r\n Ian Mokua<br />\r\n Founder, Smartblasts.co<br />\r\n ian@smartblasts.co</span></p></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table class=\"button_block\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\n					<tr>\n						<td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\">\n							<a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-admin#/responses?status=inbox&#038;r=2753\" data-tracks-link-desc=\"\">\n								<!--[if mso]>\n								<i style=\"mso-text-raise: 30pt;\">&nbsp;</i>\n								<![endif]-->\n								<span>View in dashboard</span>\n								<!--[if mso]>\n								<i>&nbsp;</i>\n								<![endif]-->\n							</a>\n						</td>\n					</tr>\n				</table>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- START FOOTER -