color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">nickrodi173@gmail.com</div></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #F0F0F0; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><tr><td class=\"field-icon-cell\" width=\"24\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 18px 16px 20px 0; width: 24px; vertical-align: top; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\"><img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/field-textarea@2x.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 24px; height: 24px; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\" /></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 20px 0;\"><div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #757575; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Message</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">Need an experienced freelance copywriter to help with those important, time-sensitive projects in 2026?<br />\r\nMy name is Nick Rodi and I’m an experienced freelance copywriter in B2B, C2B and non-profit markets.<br />\r\nAfter retiring several years ago, I have worked with both businesses and non-profits in helping them with their copywriting needs.<br />\r\nAs a freelance writer, I have nearly 40 years of experience in writing persuasive copy in the form of blogs, emails, print ads, video scripts, case studies, brochures and newsletters. <br />\r\nI feel strongly that my writing can be quite beneficial for your clients.<br />\r\nWant to view some examples of my writing? Just buzz me at 814-558-3113 or email nickrodi173@gmail.com.<br />\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNick Rodi<br />\r\n241 Courtney Drive<br />\r\nFairport, NY  14450 (located just outside Rochester)<br />\r\nnickrodi173@gmail.com</div></td></tr></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Actions -->\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table role=\"presentati