ble role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #F0F0F0; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><tr><td class=\"field-icon-cell\" width=\"24\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 18px 16px 20px 0; width: 24px; vertical-align: top; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\"><img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/field-textarea@2x.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 24px; height: 24px; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\" /></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 20px 0;\"><div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #757575; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Message</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">Hey Seoservicessk,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen was the last time you searched for your own business on Google?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI did it yesterday (for research), and I\'m guessing you\'re not thrilled with where you\'re showing up. Maybe page 2? Maybe buried on page 1 below competitors?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI\'m Deepak, Marketing Head at a digital agency. We\'ve spent 10 years getting businesses to rank higher, and honestly, your situation doesn\'t look that complicated to fix.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat I\'d like to do:<br />\r\n•	Walk you through what\'s holding you back<br />\r\n•	Share our portfolio of actual results we\'ve gotten<br />\r\n•	Give you real pricing (no \"it depends\" answers)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCall or email - you decide. Just send me:<br />\r\n•	Email address<br />\r\n•	Phone number (if talking\'s easier)<br />\r\n•	Website<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSorry for the unsolicited message. I know your inbox is probably full of this stuff. But I actually looked at your site before reaching out, which is more than most people do.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest,<br />\r\nDeepak<br />\r\nMarketing Head</div></td></tr></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Actions -->\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"button-table\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;\">\n					<tr>\n						<td class=\"button-cell\" width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 8px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">\n							<a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-admin#/responses?status=inbox&#038;r=2851&#038;mark_as_spam\" class=\"action-button action-button-secondary\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: transparent; color: #1e1e1e; border: 1px solid #1e1e1e; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; text-align: center; mso-padding-alt: 0;\">Mark as spam</a>\n						</td>\n						<td class=\"button-cell\" width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 8px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">\n							<a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-admin#/responses?status=inbox&#038;r=2851\" class=\"action-button action-button-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #3858e9; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; text-align: center; mso-padding-alt: 0;\">View in dashboard</a>\n						</td>\n					</tr>\n				</table>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Powered By -->\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"powered-by-table\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin-top: 24px;\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"powered-by\" style=\"padding: 24px 0 0 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">\n<img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/jetpack-logo@2x.png\" alt=\"Jetpack\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px; border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #50575e; line-height: 20px;\">Powered by <a href=\"https://jetpack.com/forms/?utm_source=jetpack-forms&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=form-submissions\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #50575e; text-decoration: none;\">Jetpack Forms</a></span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"collapse\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<img src=\"https://pixel.wp.com/t.gif?_en=jetpack_forms_email_open&_ui=c853ac7a3734c60103ae65d24ca4e534&_ut=anon&browser_type=php-agent&_aua=tracks-client-v0.3&_ts=1776330226102\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" />\n<style type=\"text/css\">@media print {\n	body, .body { background-color: #ffffff !important; }\n	.container { width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; padding: 0 !important; }\n	.wrapper { padding: 16px 0 !important; }\n	.main { border-radius: 0 !important; }\n	.field-icon-cell { display: none !important; width: 0 !important; max-width: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; overflow: hidden !important; }\n	.form-fields-inner { padding: 0 !important; }\n	.actions, .powered-by-table, .preheader { display: none !important; }\n	.collapse { display: none !important; }\n}</style></body>\n</html>\n\";}'),
