resentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"form-fields\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"form-fields-inner\" style=\"padding: 16px 16px 24px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #F0F0F0; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><tr><td class=\"field-icon-cell\" width=\"24\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 18px 16px 20px 0; width: 24px; vertical-align: top; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\"><img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/field-text@2x.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 24px; height: 24px; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\" /></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 20px 0;\"><div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #757575; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Name</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">Frank Vafa</div></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #F0F0F0; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><tr><td class=\"field-icon-cell\" width=\"24\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 18px 16px 20px 0; width: 24px; vertical-align: top; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\"><img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/field-email@2x.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 24px; height: 24px; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\" /></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 20px 0;\"><div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #757575; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Email</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">info@topchoiceseo.com</div></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #F0F0F0; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><tr><td class=\"field-icon-cell\" width=\"24\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 18px 16px 20px 0; width: 24px; vertical-align: top; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\"><img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/field-textarea@2x.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 24px; height: 24px; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\" /></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 20px 0;\"><div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #757575; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Message</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">Hello,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe help established local companies get featured on major media outlets including Apple News, Google News, Yahoo Canada, Toronto Sun, Canada.com, National Post, Business Insider, Associated Press, Digital Journal, and 300+ more media outlets within a few days.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a full authority-building PR campaign. We turn your media placements into trust-building assets you can use on your website, Google Business Profile, social media, and sales process to build instant trust.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur Top Choice PR package is designed to strengthen your Google presence, strengthen your presence in AI search results, and help position your business as a premium authority in your area.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMany of our clients now get leads through ChatGPT and AI search every single day because their brand has stronger media authority, media mentions, and search visibility.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe handle the news angle, writing, editing, distribution, live publication links, “Featured In” badges, press-page copy, and promotional assets. You just approve the final version.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe are currently selecting one premium business per market.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWould you be open to a free authority audit showing how your business appears on Google, ChatGPT, and major publications compared to your competitors?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest,<br />\r\nFrank Vafa<br />\r\nTop Choice PR<br />\r\ntopchoiceseo.com</div></td></tr></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Actions -->\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"button-table\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;\">\n					<tr>\n						<td class=\"button-cell\" width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 8px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">\n							<a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-responses-wp-admin&#038;p=%2Fresponses%2Finbox%3FresponseIds%3D%5B%222889%22%5D%26mark_as_spam%3D1\" class=\"action-button action-button-secondary\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: transparent; color: #1e1e1e; border: 1px solid #1e1e1e; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; text-align: center; mso-padding-alt: 0;\">Mark as spam</a>\n						</td>\n						<td class=\"button-cell\" width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 8px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">\n							<a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-responses-wp-admin&#038;p=%2Fresponses%2Finbox%3FresponseIds%3D%5B%222889%22%5D\" class=\"action-button action-button-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #3858e9; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; text-align: center; mso-padding-alt: 0;\">View in dashboard</a>\n						</td>\n					</tr>\n				</table>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Powered By -->\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"powered-by-table\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin-top: 24px;\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"powered-by\" style=\"padding: 24px 0 0 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">\n<img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/jetpack-logo@2x.png\" alt=\"Jetpack\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px; border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #50575e; line-height: 20px;\">Powered by <a href=\"https://jetpack.com/forms/?utm_source=jetpack-forms&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=form-submissions\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #50575e; text-decoration: none;\">Jetpack Forms</a></span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"collapse\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<img src=\"https://pixel.wp.com/t.gif?_en=jetpack_forms_email_open&_ui=cb6ec40246fa7bd87e01827ee401606f&_ut=anon&browser_type=php-agent&_aua=tracks-client-v0.3&_ts=1778202547093\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" />\n<style type=\"text/css\">@media print {\n	body, .body { background-color: #ffffff !important; }\n	.container { width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; padding: 0 !important; }\n	.wrapper { padding: 16px 0 !important; }\n	.main { border-radius: 0 !important; }\n	.field-icon-cell { display: none !important; width: 0 !important; max-width: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; overflow: hidden !important; }\n	.form-fields-inner { padding: 0 !important; }\n	.actions, .powered-by-table, .preheader { display: none !important; }\n	.collapse { display: none !important; }\n}</style></body>\n</html>\n\";}'),
