 margin-bottom: 8px;\">Email</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">frank@insaneleads.io</div></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #F0F0F0; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><tr><td class=\"field-icon-cell\" width=\"24\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 18px 16px 20px 0; width: 24px; vertical-align: top; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\"><img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/field-textarea@2x.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 24px; height: 24px; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\" /></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 20px 0;\"><div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #757575; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Message</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">Hi,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you looking for more clients?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you can see, this strategy works perfectly. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur system found your website and reached you right here for a fraction of a cent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow imagine getting your offer in front of thousands of targeted prospects per day just like this.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInsaneLeads.io automates the entire process: instantly find targeted business leads, launch website form campaigns, and book more opportunities without the high cost.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet started free with 250 lead gen credits:<br />\r\nwww.InsaneLeads.io<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThanks,<br />\r\nFrank, InsaneLeads.io<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReply STOP to remove yourself from our list.</div></td></tr></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Actions -->\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"button-table\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;\">\n						<tr>\n							<td class=\"button-cell\" width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 8px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">\n								<a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-responses-wp-admin&#038;p=%2Fresponses%2Finbox%3FresponseIds%3D%5B%222919%22%5D%26mark_as_spam%3D1\" class=\"action-button action-button-secondary\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: transparent; color: #1e1e1e; border: 1px solid #1e1e1e; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; text-align: center; mso-padding-alt: 0;\">Mark as spam</a>\n							</td>\n							<td class=\"button-cell\" width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 8px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">\n								<a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=jetpack-forms-responses-wp-admin&#038;p=%2Fresponses%2Finbox%3FresponseIds%3D%5B%222919%22%5D\" class=\"action-button action-button-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #3858e9; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; text-align: center; mso-padding-alt: 0;\">View in dashboard</a>\n							</td>\n						</tr>\n					</table>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Powered By -->\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"powered-by-table\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin-top: 24px;\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"powered-by\" style=\"padding: 24px 0 0 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">\n<img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/jetpack-logo@2x.png\" alt=\"Jetpack\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px; border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #50575e; line-height: 20px;\">Powered by <a href=\"https://jetpack.com/forms/?utm_source=jetpack-forms&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=form-submissions\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #50575e; text-decoration: none;\">Jetpack Forms</a></span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"collapse\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<img src=\"https://pixel.wp.com/t.gif?_en=jetpack_forms_email_open&_ui=6d9ca2cede8627d33fa304f32280d333&_ut=anon&browser_type=php-agent&_aua=tracks-client-v0.3&_ts=1780347696611\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" />\n<style type=\"text/css\">@media print {\n	body, .body { background-color: #ffffff !important; }\n	.container { width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; padding: 0 !important; }\n	.wrapper { padding: 16px 0 !important; }\n	.main { border-radius: 0 !important; }\n	.field-icon-cell { display: none !important; width: 0 !important; max-width: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; overflow: hidden !important; }\n	.form-fields-inner { padding: 0 !important; }\n	.actions, .powered-by-table, .preheader { display: none !important; }\n	.collapse { display: none !important; }\n}</style></body>\n</html>\n\";}'),
