: 15px; color: #757575; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Email</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">AlfredHagen@hagenconstructions.com</div></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #F0F0F0; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><tr><td class=\"field-icon-cell\" width=\"24\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 18px 16px 20px 0; width: 24px; vertical-align: top; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\"><img src=\"https://seoservicessk.com/wp-content/plugins/jetpack/jetpack_vendor/automattic/jetpack-forms/src/contact-form/images/field-icons/field-textarea@2x.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 24px; height: 24px; -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\" /></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 20px 0;\"><div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #757575; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Message</div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5;\">My name is Alfred D. Hagen, CEO &amp; President of Hagen Construction Inc.<br />\r\nWe are currently evaluating lead generation, sales development, marketing, customer acquisition partners and would like to learn more about your services, capabilities and pricing.<br />\r\nPlease feel free to share any information, case studies, or materials that may be helpful for our review. We would welcome the opportunity to discuss potential collaboration.<br />\r\nThank you, and I look forward to hearing from you.</div></td></tr></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Actions -->\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"button-table\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;\">\n						<tr>\n							<td class=\"button-cell\" width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 8px; font-family