500ad-f1\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-header-wrap\"><button class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title\">In how many days will the result be available?</span></span><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger\"></span></button></div><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Normally it takes 1 to 3 months for visible results, but it depends on the competition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/pane -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/pane {\"id\":2,\"uniqueID\":\"392_d1e528-54\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-2 kt-pane392_d1e528-54\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-header-wrap\"><button class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title\">What are the charges?</span></span><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger\"></span></button></div><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Charges depend on business and competition level. Contact for customized plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/pane -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/pane {\"id\":3,\"uniqueID\":\"392_45cab9-39\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-3 kt-pane392_45cab9-39\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-header-wrap\"><button class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title\">How do you select keywords?</span></span><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger\"></span></button></div><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keywords are selected after