class=\"section-title\">Why Is SEO Cost Not Fixed?</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">SEO is not a single service — it is a combination of strategies. The price depends on these 7 key factors:</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"factors-grid\">\n      <div class=\"factor-card\" data-delay=\"0\">\n        <div class=\"factor-icon\">📐</div>\n        <h4>Website Size</h4>\n        <p>A 5-page website and a 500-page website require completely different levels of SEO effort.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"factor-card\" data-delay=\"100\">\n        <div class=\"factor-icon\">⚔️</div>\n        <h4>Competition Level</h4>\n        <p>Local vs. national vs. global competition — the higher the competition, the greater the investment required.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"factor-card\" data-delay=\"200\">\n        <div class=\"factor-icon\">🔑</div>\n        <h4>Keyword Difficulty</h4>\n        <p>Ranking for high-volume, competitive keywords demands significantly more resources and time.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"factor-card\" data-delay=\"300\">\n        <div class=\"factor-icon\">⚙️</div>\n        <h4>Website Condition</h4>\n        <p>Fixing existing technical issues is a prerequisite before SEO work can begin — which adds to the cost.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"factor-card\" data-delay=\"400\">\n        <div class=\"factor-icon\">✍️</div>\n        <h4>Content Requirement</h4>\n        <p>Blogs, landing pages, product descriptions — creating quality content takes both time and budget.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"factor-card\" data-delay=\"500\">\n        <div class=\"factor-icon\">🔗</div>\n        <h4>Backlink Quality</h4>\n        <p>High-DA backlinks cost more but are essential for building long-term ranking authority.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"factor-card\" data-delay=\"600\">\n        <div class=\"factor-icon\">🧠</div>\n        <h4>Expert Experience</h4>\n        <p>A junior freelancer vs. a senior agency — experience directly impacts pricing and results.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ===== PRICING SECTION ===== -->\n<section class=\"pricing-section\" id=\"ssk-pricing\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"text-center\">\n      <span class=\"section-tag\">💰 SEO Pricing 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">SEO Charges in India</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">Choose the right package for your business — transparent pricing, no hidden fees.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pricing-tabs\">\n      <button class=\"tab-btn active\" onclick=\"sskSwitchTab(\'monthly\', this)\">📅 Monthly Packages</button>\n      <button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"sskSwitchTab(\'onetime\', this)\">⚡ One-Time Services</button>\n      <button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"sskSwitchTab(\'hourly\', this)\">⏱️ Hourly Rates</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MONTHLY -->\n    <div class=\"tab-content active\" id=\"ssk-tab-monthly\">\n      <div class=\"packages-grid\">\n        <div class=\"pkg-card\">\n          <div class=\"pkg-type\">Starter</div>\n          <div class=\"pkg-name\">Basic SEO</div>\n          <div class=\"pkg-price\">\n            <span class=\"inr\">₹5K – ₹10K</span><span class=\"month\"> /month</span>\n            <span class=\"usd\">$60 – $120/month</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pkg-divider\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pkg-for\"><strong>Best For:</strong> Small websites, startups, new businesses</div>\n          <ul class=\"pkg-features\">\n            <li>5–10 Keywords Optimization</li>\n            <li>On-Page SEO (Basic)</li>\n            <li>Google Search Console Setup</li>\n            <li>Monthly Report</li>\n            <li>Basic Technical Fixes</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/contact-us/\" class=\"pkg-cta\">Get Started →</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pkg-card featured\">\n          <div class=\"pkg-type\">Most Popular</div>\n          <div class=\"pkg