ic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How much does SEO cost in Coimbatore?</strong><br>➡️ Our plans start from ₹5,000/month – affordable and result-oriented.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Is SEO guaranteed?</strong><br>➡️ We use white hat methods which guarantee long-term ranking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Which tools are used in SEO?</strong><br>➡️ Tools like <a href=\"https://ahrefs.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ahrefs</a>, <a href=\"https://www.semrush.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEMrush</a>, <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/analytics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Google Analytics</a>, Search Console are used.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What changes happen in the website while doing SEO?</strong><br>➡️ Changes like content update, page optimization, speed improvement are made.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Can we get leads from SEO?</strong><br>➡️ Yes, <strong>targeted traffic increases both leads and sales.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Do you give monthly reporting?</strong><br>➡️ Absolutely! Every month you get a detailed report of progress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/seo-services-ahmedabad/\">SEO Services Ahmedabad: Best Result</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">📞 Contact Us</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>If you are also looking for a trusted SEO partner</strong> for your business, then contact us today:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🌐 <strong>Website:</s