(1858, 0, '2025-08-28 08:54:01', '2025-08-28 08:54:01', 'Hi,\r\nI’m Nitin Bhatnagar, an SEO Specialist with 12+ years of experience in driving measurable organic growth for 400+ websites across the U.S., UK, and Australia.\r\n\r\n I’m reaching out to explore remote SEO opportunities with your team.\r\nI specialize in:\r\nAI-powered SEO – leveraging tools like ChatGPT, Jasper, Surfer SEO, Frase &amp; MarketMuse for keyword clustering, EEAT content, and programmatic SEO.\r\nTechnical SEO – Core Web Vitals, schema markup, site speed, crawl optimization, and indexation fixes.\r\nLink Building – HARO, guest posting, digital PR, and DR 50+ editorial outreach.\r\nLocal SEO – GMB optimization, hyper-local content, schema, and map pack ranking strategies.\r\nSome highlights of my work:\r\nIncreased organic traffic by 150%+ for international clients.\r\nConsistently ranked competitive keywords from page 3 to top 5 in Google SERPs.\r\nLed SEO teams and delivered results-driven campaigns across multiple industries.\r\n# My Resume: https://drive.google.com/file/d/15z1JnW70zPej9-Qkr6oliHpkrnSYN2aH/\r\n# Upwork Profile: https://www.upwork.com/o/profiles/users/~0172a74803b98d0c72/\r\n# SEO Portfolio: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1zO3YVAt815cJPHcsZXjcTfNouSWpDapSJe28FIV-hVs/\r\n# LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/nitin-bhatnagar-20a01451/\r\nMy proven SEO expertise and ability to integrate AI into workflows can directly support your growth goals. I would love the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute in an interview.\r\nLooking forward to your response.\r\nBest Regards,\r\nNitin Bhatnagar\r\nEmail – nitinb.dmm@gmail.com\r\nWhatsApp – +918878962587\r\nTeams – Nitin Bhatnagar\n<!--more-->\nAUTHOR: Nitin Bhatnagar\nAUTHOR EMAIL: nitinb.dmm@gmail.com\nAUTHOR URL: \nSUBJECT: [seoservicessk.com] SEO Services SK\nIP: 106.222.214.139\nJSON_DATA\n{\"1_Name\":\"Nitin Bhatnagar\",\"2_Email\":\"nitinb.dmm@gmail.com\",\"3_Message\":\"Hi,\\r\\nI\\u2019m Nitin Bhatnagar, an SEO Specialist with 12+ years of experience in driving measurable organic growth for 400+ websites across the U.S., UK, and Australia.\\r\\n\\r\\n I\\u2019m reaching out to explore remote SEO opportunities with your team.\\r\\nI specialize in:\\r\\nAI-powered SEO \\u2013 leveraging tools like ChatGPT, Jasper, Surfer SEO, Frase &amp; MarketMuse for keyword clustering, EEAT content, and programmatic SEO.\\r\\nTechnical SEO \\u2013 Core Web Vitals, schema markup, site speed, crawl optimization, and indexation fixes.\\r\\nLink Building \\u2013 HARO, guest posting, digital PR, and DR 50+ editorial outreach.\\r\\nLocal SEO \\u2013 GMB optimization, hyper-local content, schema, and map pack ranking strategies.\\r\\nSome highlights of my work:\\r\\nIncreased organic traffic by 150%+ for international clients.\\r\\nConsistently ranked competitive keywords from page 3 to top 5 in Google SERPs.\\r\\nLed SEO teams and delivered results-driven campaigns across multiple industries.\\r\\n# My Resume: https:\\/\\/drive.google.com\\/file\\/d\\/15z1JnW70zPej9-Qkr6oliHpkrnSYN2aH\\/\\r\\n# Upwork Profile: https:\\/\\/www.upwork.com\\/o\\/profiles\\/users\\/~0172a74803b98d0c72\\/\\r\\n# SEO Portfolio: https:\\/\\/docs.google.com\\/spreadsheets\\/d\\/1zO3YVAt815cJPHcsZXjcTfNouSWpDapSJe28FIV-hVs\\/\\r\\n# LinkedIn: https:\\/\\/www.linkedin.com\\/in\\/nitin-bhatnagar-20a01451\\/\\r\\nMy proven SEO expertise and ability to integrate AI into workflows can directly support your growth goals. I would love the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute in an interview.\\r\\nLooking forward to your response.\\r\\nBest Regards,\\r\\nNitin Bhatnagar\\r\\nEmail \\u2013 nitinb.dmm@gmail.com\\r\\nWhatsApp \\u2013 +918878962587\\r\\nTeams \\u2013 Nitin Bhatnagar\",\"email_marketing_consent\":\"\",\"entry_title\":\"SEO Services SK\",\"entry_permalink\":\"https:\\/\\/seoservicessk.com\\/\",\"feedback_id\":\"86aa8807ad3c51c5a00c1e5f9388ecf8\"}', 'Nitin Bhatnagar - 2025-08-28 08:54:01', '', 'publish', 'clos