(1878, 0, '2025-09-02 08:51:11', '2025-09-02 08:51:11', 'Hey there,\r\n\r\nI hope you are doing well.\r\n\r\nI was checking your website and saw you have a good design and it looks great, but it\'s not AI optimized like chatgpt,‎Google Gemini &amp; perplexity other major AI.\r\n\r\nPlease let me tell you some of the techniques that I can use below to help you get a better result on  major AI:\r\n\r\n1. AI keyword clustering\r\n2. Semantic SEO with natural language optimization\r\n3. Entity SEO (for E-E-A-T and AI search ranking)\r\n4. AI image compression &amp; enhancement\r\n5. Alt tag generation via vision AI\r\n6. AI chatbot for 24/7 consultation booking, common FAQs, service guides\r\n7. Lead qualification + calendar integration\r\n8. Dynamic homepage &amp; blog content generation\r\n9. Auto-update blogs\r\n10.AI-based user behavior analysis\r\n11.Scroll maps &amp; click tracking to find weak spots\r\n12.Funnel optimization suggestions\r\n13.Core Web Vitals optimization via AI suggestions\r\n14.Lazy loading images, script deferrals using AI-based audits\r\n15.AI-based CDN selection &amp; optimization\r\n16.Optimize for Google Lens and Siri/Alexa-based search\r\n17.Structured data markup with AI tools\r\n18.Image naming, alt text, schema via AI\r\n\r\nWe\'ve got lots to do together to make you stand out!\r\n\r\nPlease give us the chance to work with you. You can see our rates on our website.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to working with you.\r\n \r\nKindest regards,\r\nCatherine Maldonado\n<!--more-->\nAUTHOR: Catherine Maldonado\nAUTHOR EMAIL: catherinesmaldonado@gmail.com\nAUTHOR URL: \nSUBJECT: [seoservicessk.com] SEO Services SK\nIP: 202.78.236.237\nJSON_DATA\n{\"1_Name\":\"Catherine Maldonado\",\"2_Email\":\"catherinesmaldonado@gmail.com\",\"3_Message\":\"Hey there,\\r\\n\\r\\nI hope you are doing well.\\r\\n\\r\\nI was checking your website and saw you have a good design and it looks great, but it\'s not AI optimized like chatgpt,\\u200eGoogle Gemini &amp; perplex