(2202, 0, '2025-10-09 08:39:25', '2025-10-09 08:39:25', 'Hi, \r\nWhile reviewing seoservicessk.com, we spotted toxic backlinks that could put your site at risk of a Google penalty. Especially that this Google SPAM update had a high impact in ranks. This is an easy and quick fix for you. Totally free of charge. No obligations. \r\n \r\nFix it now: \r\nhttps://www.professionalseocleanup.com/ \r\n \r\nNeed help or questions? Chat here: \r\nhttps://www.professionalseocleanup.com/whatsapp/ \r\n \r\nBest, \r\nMike Christopher Jones\r\n \r\n+1 (855) 221-7591 \r\ninfo@professionalseocleanup.com\n<!--more-->\nAUTHOR: Mike Christopher Jones\nAUTHOR EMAIL: info@professionalseocleanup.com\nAUTHOR URL: \nSUBJECT: [seoservicessk.com] Contact\nIP: 37.19.223.118\nJSON_DATA\n{\"1_Name\":\"Mike Christopher Jones\",\"2_Email\":\"info@professionalseocleanup.com\",\"3_Message\":\"Hi, \\r\\nWhile reviewing seoservicessk.com, we spotted toxic backlinks that could put your site at risk of a Google penalty. Especially that this Google SPAM update had a high impact in ranks. This is an easy and quick fix for you. Totally free of charge. No obligations. \\r\\n \\r\\nFix it now: \\r\\nhttps:\\/\\/www.professionalseocleanup.com\\/ \\r\\n \\r\\nNeed help or questions? Chat here: \\r\\nhttps:\\/\\/www.professionalseocleanup.com\\/whatsapp\\/ \\r\\n \\r\\nBest, \\r\\nMike Christopher Jones\\r\\n \\r\\n+1 (855) 221-7591 \\r\\ninfo@professionalseocleanup.com\",\"email_marketing_consent\":\"\",\"entry_title\":\"Contact\",\"entry_permalink\":\"https:\\/\\/seoservicessk.com\\/contact-us\\/\",\"feedback_id\":\"cd88b3a544dd1a7d2a503ad9d6dfb7e4\"}', 'Mike Christopher Jones - 2025-10-09 08:39:25', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'cd88b3a544dd1a7d2a503ad9d6dfb7e4', '', '', '2025-10-09 08:39:25', '2025-10-09 08:39:25', '', 790, 'https://seoservicessk.com/?post_type=feedback&p=2202', 0, 'feedback', '', 0);
