y to jump on a quick call to explore how I can support your projects or fill in SEO gaps your current team doesn\\u2019t cover.\\r\\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\\r\\nWarm regards,\\r\\nShrey Jain\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-message\"}]}', 'Shrey Jain - 2025-11-17 12:35:49', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'b6b2e289b25b071f2a2d1550cd9853d7', '', '', '2025-11-17 12:35:49', '2025-11-17 12:35:49', '', 1204, 'https://seoservicessk.com/?post_type=feedback&p=2352', 0, 'feedback', 'v3', 0),
(2353, 0, '2025-11-17 12:47:11', '2025-11-17 12:47:11', '{\"subject\":\"[seoservicessk.com] SEO Services SK\",\"ip\":\"49.37.33.125\",\"country_code\":null,\"user_agent\":\"Mozilla\\/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit\\/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome\\/142.0.0.0 Safari\\/537.36\",\"notification_recipients\":[],\"entry_title\":\"SEO Services SK\",\"entry_page\":1,\"source_id\":1204,\"source_type\":\"single\",\"request_url\":\"https:\\/\\/seoservicessk.com\",\"fields\":[{\"key\":\"1_Name\",\"label\":\"Name\",\"value\":\"Sharon Collins\",\"type\":\"name\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-name\"},{\"key\":\"2_Email\",\"label\":\"Email\",\"value\":\"sharon@webgrityworks.com\",\"type\":\"email\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-email\"},{\"key\":\"3_Message\",\"label\":\"Message\",\"value\":\"Hello, \\r\\n \\r\\nOur free homepage design service offer is a great way for you to see how well our design and development process works. \\r\\n \\r\\nThis no cost Trial is for apprehensive web development companies to showcase our communication and development skills. \\r\\n \\r\\nAt the end of the process you will get custom homepage layout as per your website requirements. Once the designs are final you will get the source Photoshop or Figma file with all layers in it. \\r\\n \\r\\nAfter completion, if you are happy with our services we would like to discuss the next step towards development of the complete website and we will provide absolutely no obligation project quote. If you do not wish to continue with the quote you can still use the homepage layout without any hesitation by hiring any other web development company with full copyright. \\r\\n \\r\\nTo get started please email us back or visit us at https:\\/\\/webgrityworks.com  \\r\\n \\r\\nRegards,\\r\\nSharon\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-message\"}]}', 'Sharon Collins - 2025-11-17 12:47:11', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'b0c4728b55b9d7ad35351edcf3cf5825',