alysis + keyword gap analysis</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><em>“Audit without strategy never gives the right direction.”</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Keyword Research </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We find local keywords by considering the search behavior of Virginia audiences. Example:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Local seo services Virginia</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Best seo agency in Virginia</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Virginia local business marketing</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keyword research is our strong specialty.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. On-Page SEO Optimization</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hamare on-page SEO steps include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Title tags</strong> optimization</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Meta descriptions</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>URL structure improvement</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Image alt tags</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keyword placement (LSI + Main keywords)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Schema markup (Local Business schema)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>“On-Page SEO is the foundation of a website.”</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"leve