that bring real traffic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Short-tail keywords</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Long-tail keywords</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Local keywords</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Buyer intent keywords</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the base of SEO success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/seo-by-highsoftware99-com/\">SEO By Highsoftware99.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3️⃣ <strong>On-Page SEO Optimization</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the optimization within the website:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Title tags optimize karna</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Meta descriptions improve karna</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Header tags structure</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Image alt tags</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Internal linking</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Content keyword placement</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On-page <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO helps Google</a> understand the topic of the page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4️⃣ <strong>Technical SEO</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Technical SEO makes the website smooth for search engines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>XML Sitemap optimization</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Robots.txt setup</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SSL security check</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Core Web Vitals improve</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Website structure fix</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>“Technical SEO will be strong so that ranking will be stable.”</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5️⃣ <strong>Off-Page SEO &amp; Link Building</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Backlinks increase a website\'s authority. <strong>SEO agency Serp Tsunami</strong> builds high-quality backlinks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Guest posting</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Profile backlinks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Social bookmarking</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Business listings</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Niche directory submissions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Quality links = Higher trust.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6️⃣ <strong>Local SEO Services</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Local SEO is very important for local business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://share.google/zKnVGdYBPzN3VFPhb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Google My Business</a> optimiza