(2537, 1, '2026-01-29 17:48:04', '2026-01-29 17:48:04', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Adrien Beaujeu Consultant SEO Services</strong> is a strong support system in the digital world for businesses that want to get their website to the top results on Google. In today\'s competitive online market, just building a website is not enough; it is also important to <strong>optimize</strong> it . This is what we do professionally – with strategy, planning and execution. Our focus is not just on ranking, but on <em>“real business growth through organic traffic”</em> .</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you work with <strong>Adrien Beaujeu Consultant SEO Services</strong> , you get more than just SEO, but a complete digital growth system. We understand each business individually and create customized plans tailored to its goals. Competition in every industry is different, so a single formula doesn\'t apply to everyone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">⭐ How is our SEO approach?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We believe <em>“SEO is a long-term investment, not a shortcut.”</em> That\'s why <strong>Adrien Beaujeu Consultant SEO Services</strong> uses ethical and Google-friendly techniques.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our strategy includes:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Deep research</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Smart planning</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Consistent optimization</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Performance tracking</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These 4 pillars are the foundation of any successful SEO campaign.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔟 Top SEO Related Keywords List</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These keywords are in high demand in the SEO industry:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Adrien Beaujeu, SEO Consultant Services</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Professional SEO Consultant</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Best SEO Services</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Technical SEO Expert</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Local SEO Specialist</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>SEO Optimization Agency</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Google Ranking Services</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>SEO Marketing Consultant</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Organic Traffic Growth</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Search Engine Optimization Expert</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🧰 SEO Tools We Use</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Professional tools are essential for professional results. <strong>Adrien Beaujeu Consultant SEO Services</strong> uses the latest industry tools:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Ahrefs</strong> – for backlink and competitor research</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>SEMrush</strong> – keyword aur traffic analysis</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Google Search Console</strong> – website performance monitoring</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> – user behavior tracking</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Screaming Frog</strong> – technical audit</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Ubersuggest</strong> – keyword ideas</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Moz Pro</strong> – domain authority tracking</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>GTmetrix</strong> – speed optimization</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Surfer SEO</strong> – content optimization</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>RankMath / Yoast</strong> – on-page control</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>“Right tools + right strategy = strong ranking power.”</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">📌 Detailed SEO Services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now let us tell you in detail which services exactly <strong>Adrien Beaujeu Consultant SEO Services provides.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1️⃣ <strong>SEO Website Audit</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The first step is to perform a health check on the website. In this process, we:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Detects <strong>technical errors</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Fixes <strong>broken links</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Page speed issues</strong> identify karte hain</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Mobile friendliness</strong> check karte hain</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Solves <strong>indexing problems</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Audit lets us know what is the real condition of the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2️⃣ <strong>Keyword Research &amp; Strategy</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The foundation of SEO is the right keywords. We research:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>High search volume keywords</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Low competition keywords</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Buyer intent keywords</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Location-based keywords</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All these together create a strong targeting system due to which ranking improves fast.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/seo-by-highsoftware99-com/\">SEO By Highsoftware99.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3️⃣ <strong>On-Page SEO Optimization</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On-page SEO directly tells Google what topic your page is about.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We optimize:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Title tags</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Meta descriptions</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Header tags</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Image alt text</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Internal linking</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>URL structure</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Schema markup</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every page is made search engine friendly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4️⃣ <strong>Technical SEO</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Technical SEO strengthens the backend of the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>XML sitemap setup</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Robots.txt optimization</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Core Web Vitals improvement</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>HTTPS security</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Canonical issues fix</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Crawl budget optimization</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>“Technical SEO is the engine under the hood.”</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5️⃣ <strong>Off-Page SEO &amp; Link Building</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google trusts you when other websites recommend your site. That\'s why <strong>Adrien Beaujeu Consultant SEO Services</strong> builds quality backlinks:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Guest posting</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>High authority backlinks</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Business listings</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Social bookmarking</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Profile links</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Niche directory submissions</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Quality backlinks give a powerful boost to ranking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6️⃣ <strong>Local SEO Services</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are a local business then Local SEO is a must.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We provide:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://share.google/zKnVGdYBPzN3VFPhb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Google Business Profile</a> optimization</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Local citations</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Location keywords targeting</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Map pack ranking strategy</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Review management guidance</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With Local SEO, nearby customers reach you directly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7️⃣ <strong>Content Marketing &amp; SEO Writing</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEO is incomplete without content. We create:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>SEO blogs</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Service pages</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Landing pages</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Product descriptions</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>FAQ content</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Keywords</strong> are placed naturally in every content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8️⃣ <strong>E-Commerce SEO</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Special SEO strategies are used for online stores:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Product page optimization</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Category page SEO</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Structured data</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Conversion-focused content</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Technical store audit</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This increases both sales and traffic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9️⃣ <strong>Competitor Analysis</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We analyze the entire SEO system of your competitors:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Their <strong>ranking keywords</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Their <strong>backlinks</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Their <strong>content strategy</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Unka <strong>traffic source</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Then make a better strategy from it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔟 <strong>Monthly Reporting &amp; Monitoring</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Transparency is our priority.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You get:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Monthly ranking report</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Traffic improvement data</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Work progress summary</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Next month action plan</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This will clearly show you how SEO is growing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🌟 Why choose Adrien Boijeau Consulting Services?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Customized strategies</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Long-term results</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>White hat SEO techniques</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Affordable plans</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Personal attention</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>“We deliver business growth, not rankings.”</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you choose <strong>Adrien Beaujeu Consultant SEO Services</strong> , you work with an experienced SEO partner who focuses on conversions, not just traffic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">📞 Contact Details</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to improve your website\'s ranking and need professional guidance, contact us today:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🌐 <strong>Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://seoservicessk.com</a><br>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> seoservicessbk@gmail.com<br>📍 <strong>Service Area:</strong> India &amp; Worldwide</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Adrien Beaujeu Consultant SEO Services</strong> is ready to lead your business towards organic growth. 🚀</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Adrien Beaujeu Consultant SEO', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'adrien-beaujeu-consultant-seo', '', '\nhttps://seoservicessk.com/seo-by-highsoftware99-com/', '2026-01-29 18:24:39', '2026-01-29 18:24:39', '', 0, 'https://seoservicessk.com/?p=2537', 0, 'post', '', 0),
