eting provides map</li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <p style=\"margin-top: 15px; font-style: italic;\">In one sentence, this is a powerful ranking support system.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"content-section\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">SERPEmpire vs SERPSEO – Detailed Comparison</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n                <div class=\"feature-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"feature-title\"><span class=\"feature-number\">1</span>Features Comparison</h3>\n                    <div class=\"card-content\">\n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>SERPEmpire:</strong> Natural CTR improvement</p>\n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>SERPSEO:</strong> Keyword-focused ranking campaigns</p>\n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>SERPEmpire:</strong> Long-term behavior simulation</p>\n                        <p><strong>SERPSEO:</strong> Fast ranking testing options</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"feature-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"feature-title\"><span class=\"feature-number\">2</span>Safety & Risk Level</h3>\n                    <div class=\"card-content\">\n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Safety is a critical factor when using SERPEmpire vs SERPSEO.</p>\n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">The Serpempire pattern looks more natural</p>\n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">SERPSEO me aggressive campaign setting possible hoti hai</p>\n                        <p>The best practice is to use both in a balanced manner.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"feature-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"feature-title\"><span class=\"feature-numb