e across 5, 10, or 20+ client accounts with predictable execution and outcomes.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe system has already generated over $1M in closed sales, with a current $750K deal in the pipeline sourced through it.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhat time works best for you on Thursday for a video call to discuss potential synergies?\\r\\n\\r\\nAttentively,\\r\\nJorge Lanzas\\r\\nOwner\\r\\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/jorgelanzas/\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-message\"}]}', 'Jorge Lanzas - 2026-02-09 19:34:52', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'a5504b1689f33cec4ade76a5240b1af0', '', '', '2026-02-09 19:34:52', '2026-02-09 19:34:52', '', 1204, 'https://seoservicessk.com/?post_type=feedback&p=2660', 0, 'feedback', 'v3', 0),
