(2690, 0, '2026-02-16 07:20:46', '2026-02-16 07:20:46', '{\"subject\":\"[seoservicessk.com] SEO Services SK\",\"ip\":\"117.214.4.183\",\"country_code\":null,\"user_agent\":\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\",\"notification_recipients\":[],\"entry_title\":\"SEO Services SK\",\"entry_page\":1,\"source_id\":1204,\"source_type\":\"single\",\"request_url\":\"https://seoservicessk.com\",\"fields\":[{\"key\":\"1_Name\",\"label\":\"Name\",\"value\":\"Bablu Gope\",\"type\":\"name\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-name\"},{\"key\":\"2_Email\",\"label\":\"Email\",\"value\":\"babluseoexpert@gmail.com\",\"type\":\"email\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-email\"},{\"key\":\"3_Message\",\"label\":\"Message\",\"value\":\"Hello there,\\r\\n\\r\\nI hope you are doing well! I\'m a guest post service provider. Currently, I do work for all niches including business, finance, travel, insurance, technology, health, education, news and more. I have lots of high-quality websites where I can able to publish your quality content. Looking for link building services? If yes then I have some good quality sites (9000+)to offer you DA 30+, DA 60+ &amp; above sites at an affordable price. If you wish then I can also provide you with HQ articles.\\r\\n\\r\\nSome example from my sites:\\r\\n1) theodysseyonline.com  DA 85\\r\\n2) homemoving.home.blog  DA 89\\r\\n3) tapscape.com   DA 78\\r\\n4) myfancyhouse.com  DA 78\\r\\n5) justwebworld.com DA 68\\r\\n6) healthsourcemag.com  DA 73\\r\\n7) tripoutlook.com  DA 75\\r\\n8) priceofbusiness.com  DA 69\\r\\n9) kafila.org  DA 61\\r\\n10) feedsportal.com DA 85\\r\\n\\r\\nI can also provide High Authority sites techtimes.com, feedsportal.com, businessner.com etc.\\r\\nYou can use my resource and I am sure you will get good result within a couple of months.\\r\\nPlease let me know if you are interested.\\r\\n\\r\\nMany Thanks!\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-message\"}]}', 'Bablu Gope - 2026-02-16 07:20:46', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', '539b2f145d1b7a14bfc90983d1a047d2', '', '', '2026-02-16 07:20:46', '2026-02-16 07:20:46', '', 1204, 'https://seoservicessk.com/?post_type=feedback&p=2690', 0, 'feedback', 'v3', 0),
(2692, 0, '2026-02-16 16:41:01', '2026-02-16 16:41:01', '{\"subject\":\"[seoservicessk.com] SEO Services SK\",\"ip\":\"152.58.162.45\",\"country_code\":null,\"user_agent\":\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\",\"notification_recipients\":[],\"entry_title\":\"SEO Services SK\",\"entry_page\":1,\"source_id\":1204,\"source_type\":\"single\",\"request_url\":\"https://seoservicessk.com\",\"fields\":[{\"key\":\"1_Name\",\"label\":\"Name\",\"value\":\"Durlav Gouswami\",\"type\":\"name\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-name\"},{\"key\":\"2_Email\",\"label\":\"Email\",\"value\":\"durlav.linkbuilders@gmail.com\",\"type\":\"email\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-email\"},{\"key\":\"3_Message\",\"label\":\"Message\",\"value\":\"Hello,\\r\\n\\r\\nAre you aiming to boost your rankings with guest posts?\\r\\n\\r\\nI\'m working with a reputable SEO firm that specialises in guest posting, content creation, and link building. Our well-crafted content aims to drive substantial traffic to your website. I have the skills and resources to create high-quality articles published on reputable sites.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you\'d like to improve your online presence, let\\u2019s connect to see how my services can help.\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g1204-message\"}]}', 'Durlav Gouswami - 2026-02-16 16:41:01', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'fc143572fee05533ee6789d353355200', '', '', '2026-02-16 16:41:01', '2026-02-16 16:41:01', '', 1204, 'https://seoservicessk.com/?post_type=feedback&p=2692', 0, 'feedback', 'v3', 0),
(2693, 0, '2026-02-16 17:51:23', '2026-02-16 17:51:23', '{\"subject\":\"[seoservicessk.com] Contact\",\"ip\":\"182.69.180.38\",\"country_code\":null,\"user_agent\":\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; WOW64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/114.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Vivaldi/5.3.2679.68\",\"notification_recipients\":[],\"entry_title\":\"Contact\",\"entry_page\":1,\"source_id\":790,\"source_type\":\"single\",\"request_url\":\"https://seoservicessk.com/contact-us\",\"fields\":[{\"key\":\"1_Name\",\"label\":\"Name\",\"value\":\"Manshi Gupta\",\"type\":\"name\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g790-name\"},{\"key\":\"2_Email\",\"label\":\"Email\",\"value\":\"manshi.dgtlsolution4@gmail.com\",\"type\":\"email\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g790-email\"},{\"key\":\"3_Message\",\"label\":\"Message\",\"value\":\"Hello Team https://seoservicessk.com/,\\r\\n \\r\\nIf you\\u2019re looking to scale your agency fast without increasing overhead, we are ready to step in as your dedicated white-label offshore website design and SEO powerhouse.\\r\\n \\r\\nWe don\\u2019t just \\u201csupport\\u201d agencies, we help them grow aggressively.\\r\\n \\r\\nWhat We Bring Under Your Brand: \\r\\n* White-label website design (WordPress, Shopify,  custom builds)\\r\\n* SEO services: on-page, technical, content, and link building\\r\\n* Dedicated team working under your brand\\r\\n* Fast turnaround with scalable execution\\r\\n* Competitive pricing with healthy agency margins\\r\\n* Transparent reporting and clear communication\\r\\n* Experience serving international markets (US, UK, AU, CA)\\r\\n* Flexible monthly retainers or project-based engagement\\r\\nYou focus on closing deals and scaling revenue.\\r\\nWe handle delivery, performance, and results.\\r\\n \\r\\nIf you\'re serious about expanding capacity, increasing margins, and building a long-term backend team \\u2014 let\\u2019s talk.\\r\\n \\r\\nLooking forward to building something powerful together.\\r\\n \\r\\nBest regards,\\r\\nManshi\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"meta\":[],\"form_field_id\":\"g790-message\"}]}', 'Manshi Gupta - 2026-02-16 17:51:23', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', '3dfea3a9751357dcf18254cb1fc40712', '', '', '2026-02-16 17:51:23', '2026-02-16 17:51:23', '', 790, 'https://seoservicessk.com/?post_type=feedback&p=2693', 0, 'feedback', 'v3', 0),
(2694, 1, '2026-06-06 05:28:04', '2026-06-06 05:28:04', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Local SEO Services by Garage2global are the key to getting your business to the top of your city and area. We understand that in today\'s digital age, if your business isn\'t visible online, you\'re missing out.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search Engine Optimization &amp; Marketing</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this article, we\'ll discuss in detail how our strategy helps your brand reach local customers. Whether your business is small or large, the right SEO techniques are essential for everyone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/agence-instagram-valueyournetwork-matters/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Agence Instagram Valueyournetwork Matters</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why is Local SEO important?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/local-seo-services-by-garage2global/#\">&nbsp;When a customer searches</a>&nbsp;for \"nearby\" on Google&nbsp;, they only see businesses that are optimized. If your business isn\'t in the top results, you could be losing potential customers to your competitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our expertise helps you dominate Google Maps and organic local search rankings. We ensure your online presence supports the growth of your physical store or office.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Humari Comprehensive SEO Services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We have an expert team that focuses on every aspect. Below are details of our main services:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">On-Page SEO</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the process where we optimize your website\'s content and HTML source code. This includes correct keyword placement and metadata fixing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search Engines</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We adhere to <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Google Search Central guidelines</a>. Proper structure improves both user experience and search engine readability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/google-ads-for-doctors-seo-outline-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Google Ads for Doctors SEO Outline</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Off-Page SEO</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are activities outside of your website that increase your site\'s authority. High-quality backlinks and social media promotion play a role in this.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Backlinks increase your domain\'s trust score, making it easier to move up in the rankings. Platforms like <a href=\"https://ahrefs.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ahrefs </a>help us plan the best strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Technical SEO</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is about improving technical aspects of the backend. This includes optimizing site speed, mobile-friendliness, and XML sitemaps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A fast-loading website scores well on&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://pagespeed.web.dev/\">Google PageSpeed ​​Insights</a>&nbsp;. We ensure that Google\'s crawlers have no problems indexing your site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Local SEO (Google Business Profile)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GBP optimization is the most important part of Local SEO Services by Garage2global. We focus on your profile setup, review management, and local citations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your NAP (Name, Address, Phone) consistency is crucial for local rankings. This&nbsp;helps you top the local pack according to&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://www.brightlocal.com/learn/local-seo/\">BrightLocal \'s guides.</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/seo-agency-in-usa-glorvix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Agency in USA Glorvix</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Industry Ke Top 10 SEO Keywords</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choosing the right keywords is crucial for SEO ranking. Here are the top 10 keywords that should be in your strategy:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search Engine Optimization &amp; Marketing</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Keyword</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Local SEO services</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Best SEO company near me</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>On-page SEO techniques</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Google Maps ranking</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Organic traffic growth</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Professional link building</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Website audit services</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Technical SEO optimization</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Content marketing strategy</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Increase domain authority</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SEO Industry Mein Use Hone Wale Top Tools</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use premium tools to achieve the best results in the industry. These tools help us make data-driven decisions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> This tool gives you detailed reports on user behavior and traffic sources. You can see what people are doing on your site through <a href=\"https://marketingplatform.google.com/about/analytics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Google Analytics</a><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://analytics.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> .</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>SEMrush:</strong> This is the world\'s best tool for competition analysis. <a href=\"https://www.semrush.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEMrush</a> helps us track competitors\' keywords and backlinks.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Google <a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/local-seo-services-by-garage2global/#\"> Search</a> Console:</strong> This is a tool for direct communication with Google. <a href=\"https://search.google.com/search-console/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Search Console</a> tells you about indexing errors and search performance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Yoast SEO:</strong> If you\'re using WordPress, this plugin is great. <a href=\"https://yoast.com/wordpress/plugins/seo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Yoast</a> makes on-page optimization incredibly easy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Local SEO Services by Garage2global: Humari Approach</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>We believe that every business has unique needs. That\'s why we create customized strategies rather than generic packages.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search Engines</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you choose Local SEO Services by Garage2global, you get results, not just services. We share transparent reports so you can see your progress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/seo-instant-appear-high-software-99/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Instant Appear High Software 99</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Optimization</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Better Visibility:</strong> People in your area can find you easily.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Increased Leads:</strong> When people can find you, calls and visits increase.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Brand Trust:</strong> Google rankings increase the credibility of your brand.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Local SEO Services by Garage2global is the perfect partner for your digital growth. Contact us today to take your business to the next level.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Questions and Answers (FAQs)</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Do Local SEO Services by Garage2global work for all businesses?</strong>&nbsp;Yes, whether you own a salon, a restaurant, or a professional firm, local SEO is essential for everyone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search Engine Optimization &amp; Marketing</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How long does it take to see results?</strong>&nbsp;SEO is a gradual process, often taking 3 to 6 months to see good results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Do you also write content?</strong>&nbsp;Of course, Local SEO Services by Garage2global also specializes in content marketing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Do you only do local SEO?</strong>&nbsp;No, we provide full-stack SEO services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What is the pricing model?</strong>&nbsp;We offer affordable prices based on the complexity of your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Local SEO Services by Garage2global brings you the best digital solutions. Consistency and patience are the keys to SEO success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/https-goo-gl-chssta/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Https Goo Gl Chssta</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact Us</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to boost your business\'s ranking? Contact us today and book your consultation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://seoservicessk.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">seoservicessk.com</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> seoservicessbk@gmail.com</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Phone:</strong> +91-XXXXXXXXXX</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start your digital journey and get ahead of the competition with Local SEO Services by Garage2global. We look forward to seeing your business grow.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Local SEO Services by Garage2global', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'local-seo-services-by-garage2global', '', '\nhttps://seoservicessk.com/agence-instagram-v